# --- Defense-in-depth: NEVER commit per-instance secrets/data (public repo) ---
# Storage dirs are normally stora/ storb/ storage/ (above), but also guard the
# generated artifact names directly, in case an instance is created in-repo
# under a non-standard name (e.g. `retalert --storage ./mytest`). The `identity`
# blob and the rns/ store hold PRIVATE KEYS.
# Anchored to repo root so they do NOT match the Kotlin source package
# android/.../reticulum/lxmf/ (which must be tracked). Instance data lives in
# stora/ storb/ storage/ (ignored above) or at repo root when run in-tree.
identity
/rns/
/lxmf/
keys.json
inbox.json
contacts.json
presets.json
groups.json
settings.json
alerts.json
starred.json
shared_instance.json

# Android release signing keys — PRIVATE. Never commit. (Configure CI signing
# via repo secrets; see docs/ANDROID_SIGNING.md.)
*.keystore
*.jks
*.keystore.b64
key.properties

# Downloaded offline map caches
maps/
*.mbtiles

# Vendored upstream composite-build clone (LXMF-kt) — cloned locally AND in CI,
# never committed. See android/settings.gradle.kts includeBuild + .github/workflows.
# Pin: git clone --depth 1 --branch v0.0.14 https://github.com/torlando-tech/LXMF-kt lxmf-kt
lxmf-kt/